# Feature: Notifications & escalations

| Event | Recipients | Trigger |
|---|---|---|
| Task Assigned | Assigned employee + supervisor | Immediately after commit |
| Task Due Soon | Employee | Configurable hours before DueAt |
| Task Overdue | Employee + Design Head | DueAt crossed and not complete |
| Correction Raised | Responsible person + Design Head | Immediately |
| Approval Pending | Approver | Immediately and reminders |
| Material/Machine Hold | Relevant department + Design Head | On HOLD reason |
| Production Release | Production Head | On final release |

## Architecture rule
Notifications are emitted **after** the business transaction commits, via an
outbox/queue pattern, so a WhatsApp/email/push failure can never roll back
core ERP work.
